sequenceDiagram
    participant FCM
    participant Svc as MessagingService
    participant TM as FcmTokenManager
    participant API as Backend

    FCM->>Svc: onNewToken(newToken)
    Svc->>TM: refreshAndUpsert(newToken)
    TM->>API: PUT /devices {userId, deviceId, token} (authed)
    Note over API: old token pruned on next UNREGISTERED send
